To update from 1.1/1.2 of H&S to 1.3 you should do the following:

Make a copy of any files you've modified, configs, menus, etc.

Extract the new archive over your existing files.

Replace any of your modified files.

The most important files that have changed in this release are:

   Hack&Slash.config - a new path has been added to it.
   Menu/ - All the graphics files have been moved to Pics/
   Pics/ - New directory conataing graphic files.  Contains various sub-dirs.

